{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-bring-residue-resolvent","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:bring-residue-resolvent","kind":"proposition","title":"Bring residue to canonical resolvent form $1/(1 - h_q \\cdot q^{\\alpha_{\\mathrm{shift}}})$","cites":["references/suslin1991","references/thurston1978"],"tags":["normalization","no-fitting","uniqueness","bring","residue"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.bring_residue_equation","text":"bring-residue-resolvent.md","leanSource":"bring-residue-resolvent.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:bring-residue-resolvent\"></a><p><em>The substrate evaluation of the residue / Schwarz integral on\nBring's surface around the simple pole of order <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma</code>\non the torus knot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(p, k)</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha_{\\text{shift}}(p, k) = n</code>\nyields the canonical resolvent form</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  F_n(q) = \\frac{1}{1 - h_q \\cdot q^n}, \\qquad h_q = q - q^{-1},</code></pre>\n<p><em>the</em> <strong>shared closed-form derivation</strong> <em>across the α_shift\nuniversal chain's specialisations.</em></p>\n<p>The open math, the conditional closure, and the downstream consequence are collected in\n<a href=\"#rem:bring-residue-resolvent-context\" data-at=\"mass-theory/hoefsmit-convergence-magic-shells/hoefsmit-he4-magic-a-binding\">the Bring-residue resolvent context</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/bring-residue-resolvent.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.7.17","page":"b/prop-bring-residue-resolvent","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BraidKnot.bring_residue_equation","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/bring-residue-resolvent.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
